{
  "_comment": [
    "Universal Login theme, mapped from the console's dark tokens in",
    "apps/dashboard/src/index.css. Applied by:",
    "  npm run bootstrap -- --provision-auth0-branding --stage <name>",
    "",
    "Keys beginning with _ are stripped before this is sent (see withoutComments",
    "in ../auth0.ts) — the Management API rejects unknown fields.",
    "",
    "This file covers only what the theme API can express. Spacing, control",
    "height, widget width, line-height and letter-spacing have no fields here",
    "and live in page-template.liquid instead.",
    "",
    "fonts.font_url carries the Regular face as the fallback for tenants whose",
    "plan does not support a page template. IBM Plex Mono has no variable face,",
    "so the paid-plan template adds explicit Regular and Medium @font-face rules",
    "behind a real monospace fallback.",
    "",
    "Auth0 validates all three radius fields with a minimum of 1 even when the",
    "style is sharp, so 1 is the closest API-valid representation of square.",
    "",
    "The logo and both woff2 files are published from the sources and exact",
    "hashes recorded in ASSETS.md. Bootstrap refuses to apply unless every",
    "asset resolves with CORS for the Universal Login origin."
  ],

  "displayName": "boxlite-console",

  "colors": {
    "widget_background": "#1A1D24",
    "widget_border": "#2A2F3A",

    "header": "#FFFFFF",
    "body_text": "#FFFFFF",
    "input_labels_placeholders": "#8C919C",
    "icons": "#8C919C",

    "input_background": "#13161B",
    "input_border": "#2A2F3A",
    "input_filled_text": "#FFFFFF",

    "primary_button": "#FFFFFF",
    "primary_button_label": "#13161B",
    "secondary_button_border": "#2A2F3A",
    "secondary_button_label": "#FFFFFF",

    "links_focused_components": "#00B0F0",
    "base_focus_color": "#00B0F0",
    "base_hover_color": "#232833",

    "error": "#E05548",
    "success": "#5AD67D",
    "read_only_background": "#232833",
    "captcha_widget_theme": "dark"
  },

  "borders": {
    "buttons_style": "sharp",
    "inputs_style": "sharp",
    "button_border_radius": 1,
    "input_border_radius": 1,
    "widget_corner_radius": 1,
    "button_border_weight": 1,
    "input_border_weight": 1,
    "widget_border_weight": 1,
    "show_widget_shadow": false
  },

  "fonts": {
    "font_url": "https://boxlite-auth-assets-boxlite-ai.pages.dev/ibm-plex-mono-400.woff2",
    "reference_text_size": 13,
    "title": { "bold": false, "size": 123 },
    "subtitle": { "bold": false, "size": 92 },
    "body_text": { "bold": false, "size": 100 },
    "buttons_text": { "bold": false, "size": 100 },
    "input_labels": { "bold": false, "size": 100 },
    "links": { "bold": false, "size": 100 },
    "links_style": "normal"
  },

  "page_background": {
    "background_color": "#13161B",
    "background_image_url": "",
    "page_layout": "center"
  },

  "widget": {
    "header_text_alignment": "center",
    "logo_position": "center",
    "logo_height": 36,
    "logo_url": "https://boxlite-auth-assets-boxlite-ai.pages.dev/boxlite-light.png",
    "social_buttons_layout": "bottom"
  }
}
